      "TEXT": "Imperial Assassin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "INTRO - ELF",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Draniell \n\u0022The Human presence has notably increased over the last few months, but it is strange, they do not seem to be tied with Emry\u0027s Empire...more like outcasts...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Draniell \n\u0022Recently a powerful clan of Human Pilgrims has appeared; if they manage to unify the other groups of the region, their strength will become a problem for us. We must prevent this by removing their leader!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "INTRO - EMPIRE",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Karasten \n\u0022We must gather the rival clans in the area and forge alliances or else we will never manage to push back the Elves and Demons. We must gain the support of Drevrieve, Clansmith and Bragren.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Karasten \n\u0022I doubt they will listen to any grunts I send their way, so I will need to go myself. That should be proof enough of our intentions.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "INTRO - LEGION",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Garkumat \n\u0022We hunger...why wait? We...hunger...Humans, so many now...we must feed.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Herasin \n\u0022How could I hold you all back? Bethrezen has left us here to rot, but we will not go easily. Hear me Demons, the Humans are amassing themselves, we must not let them continue to grow in number.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Herasin \n\u0022An army is always harder to tear down, especially when we are weakened. Prevent this; devour the leader of the main group. His death will spark confusion among the lesser ones, making it easy for us to feast once more.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - EMPIRE - WIN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Karasten \n\u0022Our control over this area is now complete. The Empire has turned their back upon us so we will begin anew. My loyal Pilgrims, we are home.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "KARASTEN - Clansmith",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Karasten \n\u0022The citizens of Clansmith have allied with us! We must maintain our control of this city.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "KARASTEN - Bragen",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Karasten \n\u0022The citizens of Bragen have allied with us! We\u0027ll  need to help forify this city quickly!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "KARASTEN - Drevrieve",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Karasten \n\u0022The people of Drevrieve have allied with us! Prepare the defenses. We will not be caught unprepared by invaders!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - LEGION - WIN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Herasin \n\u0022The one has fallen! Tonight the land shall be blood red. The echos of horror shall sound once more! Let us begin the feast!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - ELF - WIN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Draniell \n\u0022Our grove is safe once more. The Human threat has been removed...for now.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "KILL - KARASTEN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Pilgrim leader was slain and his military orders intercepted.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "KARASTEN KILLED",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S204SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S204EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The untimely death of Karasten resulted in chaos among the Pilgrims. A lengthy and brutal war ignited, causing heavy losses to all involved.\u0022",
